        {
          "text": "Lino kuciindi cakusalazya bulambo bwa-Jerusalemu, bakayandaula ba-Levi kumasena aabo oonse, kuti babalete ku-Jerusalemu, basekelele ipobwe lyakusalazya, cakukondwa acakulumba acakwiimba, amyeembo anyeele atuntimbwa. ",
