          "text": "abanyina Semaya a-Azareli, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Netaneli, a-Jehuda, Hanani, bali azibelesyo zyakwiimbya zya-Davida muntu wa-Leza. Alakwe Ezara mupaizi nguwakabasololela. ",
