        {
          "text": "Lino kumulyango wacikala bakalulama kutanta kumatantilo aamunzi wa-Davida, kumatantilo aabulambo, kujulu lyaŋanda ya-Davida, mane kusikila kumulyango wamaanzi wakujwe. ",
