        },
        {
          "text": "Ankamu yabili yabasikutembaula bakaya kuyooswanaana abo, ambebo ndakali kubatobela, acisela cabantu ibakali abulambo, kuzwa kuŋanda indamfu yaziko mane kusikila kubulambo bukwazeme, ",
