          "text": "akuzwa kumulyango wa-Efraimu, kufwaafwi kumulyango wakalekale, amulyango wanswi, aŋanda indamfu ya-Hananeeli, aŋanda indamfu ya-Mea, mane kusikila kumulyango wambelele. Elyo bakaima mumulyango wabalindizi. ",
