          "text": "Aboobo bakalanga bulangizi bwa-Leza wabo abulangizi bwakusalazya, Abalo basimilyango abasikwiimba bakacita mbubonya, mbubonya mbwaakalailila Davida amwanaakwe Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
